## 🧪 Experimental Environment

The experiments corresponding to these figures, tables, and Python files were conducted in the following environment.

| Parameter | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Emulator | Mininet |
| SDN Controller | POX |
| Switch | OpenFlow switch (single-switch topology) |
| Hosts | Multiple hosts generating traffic toward two backend servers |
| Environments | Homogeneous (2 identical servers) and heterogeneous (2 servers with different CPU/RAM) |
| Metrics | Average waiting time, average service time, average execution time |
| Statistical Tool | OriginPro 2026 (95% confidence interval, Cohen's d, normality tests) |

